      "name": "Belly Grease",
      "actions": 3,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The slurk extrudes a slippery grease from its ventral glands to coat the floor under it and in a 5ft Emanation, turning the affected area into uneven ground for 10 minutes, after which it dries to a putrid crust. The DC to Balance across the slime is 20.</p>",
